%% Omni-vite — Event Lifecycle / State Diagram
%% "Expired" is a proposed addition, not in the original spec:
%% nothing states what happens to a draft that never reaches 10 co-signs.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> PendingCoSigns : creator submits + invites 10
  PendingCoSigns --> PendingCoSigns : co-sign accepted (count < 10)
  PendingCoSigns --> Published : 10th co-sign accepted
  PendingCoSigns --> Expired : proposed — deadline passes, count < 10
  Published --> Archived : end time passes
  Expired --> [*]
  Archived --> [*]
